#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/curves_avfilter.rst:43
msgid ""
"This effect/filter adjusts shadows, midtones and highlights of an image "
"using curves. It is similar to the :doc:`/effects_and_filters/video_effects/"
"color_image_correction/color_levels` or :doc:`/effects_and_filters/"
"video_effects/color_image_correction/levels` effects but with the option to "
"create additional points along the curve allowing for pinpoint accuracy when "
"adjusting brightness values."
msgstr ""
"Este efeito/filtro ajusta as sombras, os tons médios e os realces de uma "
"imagem utilizando curvas. Ele é semelhante aos efeitos :doc:`/"
"effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/color_levels` ou :"
"doc:`/effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/levels`, mas "
"oferece a opção de criar pontos adicionais ao longo da curva, permitindo uma "
"precisão absoluta ao ajustar os valores de luminosidade."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/curves_avfilter.rst:47
msgid "Tabs"
msgstr "Abas"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/curves_avfilter.rst:54
msgid "Tab"
msgstr "Aba"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/curves_avfilter.rst:56
msgid "All"
msgstr "Todos"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/curves_avfilter.rst:57
msgid "The curve applies to all color channels equally"
msgstr "A curva se aplica igualmente a todos os canais de cor"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/curves_avfilter.rst:58
msgid "R"
msgstr "R"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/curves_avfilter.rst:59
msgid "The curve applies to the red channel only"
msgstr "A curva se aplica apenas ao canal vermelho"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/curves_avfilter.rst:60
msgid "G"
msgstr "G"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/curves_avfilter.rst:61
msgid "The curve applies to the green channel only"
msgstr "A curva se aplica apenas ao canal verde"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/curves_avfilter.rst:62
msgid "B"
msgstr "B"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/curves_avfilter.rst:63
msgid "The curve applies to the blue channel only"
msgstr "A curva se aplica apenas ao canal azul"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/curves_avfilter.rst:68
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "Parâmetros"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/curves_avfilter.rst:75
msgid "Parameter"
msgstr "Parâmetro"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/curves_avfilter.rst:77
msgid "In"
msgstr "Entrada"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/curves_avfilter.rst:78
msgid ""
"The X coordinate of the selected point. Defines the luma input value. Use "
"this input field for very fine adjustments of the curve."
msgstr ""
"A coordenada X do ponto selecionado. Define o valor de entrada de "
"luminância. Utilize este campo de entrada para ajustes muito precisos da "
"curva."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/curves_avfilter.rst:79
msgid "Out"
msgstr "Saída"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/curves_avfilter.rst:80
msgid ""
"The Y coordinate of the selected point. Defines the luma output value. Use "
"this input field for very fine adjustments of the curve."
msgstr ""
"A coordenada Y do ponto selecionado. Define o valor de saída de luminância. "
"Utilize este campo de entrada para ajustes muito precisos da curva."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/curves_avfilter.rst:81
msgid "Reset curve"
msgstr "Redefinir curva"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/curves_avfilter.rst:82
msgid "Resets the curve in the selected tab to a straight line"
msgstr "Redefine a curva na aba selecionada para uma linha reta"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/curves_avfilter.rst:86
msgid ""
"You can adjust the curve by dragging any point of the curve. This will "
"create a new handle (indicated by a red dot) that can be adjusted any time "
"later."
msgstr ""
"Você pode ajustar a curva arrastando qualquer ponto dela. Isso criará uma "
"nova alça (indicada por um ponto vermelho) que poderá ser ajustada "
"posteriormente a qualquer momento."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/curves_avfilter.rst:88
msgid ""
"Existing points can be deleted with :kbd:`RMB` |input-mouse-click-right|"
msgstr ""
"Pontos existentes podem ser excluídos com :kbd:`RMB` |input-mouse-click-"
"right|"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/curves_avfilter.rst:91
msgid "Example"
msgstr "Exemplo"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/curves_avfilter.rst:94
msgid "Curves (avfilter) with all channels adjusted differently"
msgstr "Curvas (avfilter) com todos os canais ajustados de forma diferente"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/curves_avfilter.rst:99
msgid ""
"It is recommended to use this effect while in Color layout as this comes "
"with :ref:`RGB Parade <view-rgb_parade>` and :ref:`view-histogram` already "
"switched on. If you want to use the effect while in Editing or Effects "
"layout, turn on the Histogram :term:`widget` with :menuselection:`Menu --> "
"View --> Histogram`."
msgstr ""
"Recomenda-se utilizar este efeito no layout de Cor, pois ele já vem com o :"
"ref:`Parada RGB <view-rgb_parade>` e o :ref:`view-histogram` ativados. Se "
"você quiser usar o efeito nos layouts de Edição ou Efeitos, ative o :term:"
"`widget` de Histograma em :menuselection:`Menu --> Exibir --> Histograma`."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/curves_avfilter.rst:102
msgid ""
"Use the split-screen function of the effect panel to compare the effect with "
"the original. You can enable it with |view-split-left-right|. See :ref:"
"`effect_stack_functions`."
msgstr ""
"Use a função de tela dividida do painel de efeitos para comparar o efeito "
"com o original. Você pode ativá-la com |view-split-left-right|. Consulte :"
"ref:`effect_stack_functions`."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/curves_avfilter.rst:105
msgid ""
":doc:`/effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/"
"curves_frei0r` does the same thing but only allows one channel to be "
"adjusted."
msgstr ""
":doc:`/effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/"
"curves_frei0r` faz a mesma coisa, mas permite ajustar apenas um canal."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/curves_avfilter.rst:108
msgid ""
"The :doc:`Bezier Curves </effects_and_filters/video_effects/"
"color_image_correction/bezier_curves>` effect does the same but has the "
"ability to adjust the steepness/flatness of the curves."
msgstr ""
"O efeito :doc:`Curvas de bézier </effects_and_filters/video_effects/"
"color_image_correction/bezier_curves>` faz o mesmo, mas tem a capacidade de "
"ajustar a inclinação ou o achatamento das curvas."
